{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45590","headline":"还举人歌行卷 · 贯休","name":"还举人歌行卷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"厚於铁围山上铁，薄似双成仙体缬。\n蜀机凤雏动蹩躠，珊瑚枝枝撑着月。\n王恺家中藏难掘，颜回饥僝愁天雪。\n古松直笔雷不折，雪衣女啄蟠桃缺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45590.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45590","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}